bluejetty:00040699:ios.description:
An exciting coloring game for children that will give a lot of emotions to your kid!
Your kid will feel like a real artist and will make you happy with amazing drawings. Ideal for children of all ages!
 Offers:
 - 5 thematic sets with 75 coloring pages;
 - A huge selection of tools: pencils, brushes, paints, various strokes and colors;
 - A lot of backgrounds for decoration and special effects;
 - Development of the kid’s imagination;
 - Simple and convenient controls for kids;
 - Saving drawings and no advertising.
The game is designed specifically for preschoolers. All drawings and assignments include educational elements for the development of logic and fine motor skills. The drawings are prepared thoroughly and approved by specialists in the field of children's education.
